{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yp4fmhwr","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":70,"top":180,"width":540,"height":350},"text":"Preserved the existing market-analysis dashboard.\nEvaluated six forecasting approaches with ten metrics.\nSelected M0 Persistence using validation MAE of 128.2 INR/q.\nMeasured held-out MAE of 101.4 INR/q and RMSE of 181.0 INR/q.\nDelivered saved next-report forecasts and reproducible evidence.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Times New Roman","color":"#20252B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lcvehwvi","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":690,"top":126,"width":420,"height":38},"text":"Future scope","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23.8,"typeface":"Times New Roman","color":"#17365D","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/krmxorex","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":690,"top":180,"width":470,"height":350},"text":"Broaden market and commodity coverage.\nAdd verified weather and consistently measured arrivals.\nCollect a longer historical series and refresh the data.\nEvaluate fixed calendar horizons separately.\nRevisit tuning only after stronger coverage becomes available.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Times New Roman","color":"#20252B","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jmhgrqdg","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":270,"top":560,"width":740,"height":68},"text":"Measured improvement versus persistence: 0.0%\nThe baseline won, so no unsupported ML advantage is claimed.","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#EEF4F0","lineColor":"#2F6B4F","lineWidth":1,"style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Times New Roman","color":"#20252B","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}}
